.TH "JSONKIT\-MANPAGE" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-manpage \- Write or install the man pages.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit manpage\fR <command> [options]
.fi
.SH "COMMANDS"
.TP
\fBgenerate\fR
Write the man pages to a folder.
.TP
\fBinstall\fR
Install the man pages in your home folder.
.TP
\fBupdate\fR
Bring installed man pages up to date with this version.
.TP
\fBuninstall\fR
Remove the installed man pages.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-manpage\-generate\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-manpage\-install\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-manpage\-update\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-manpage\-uninstall\fR(1)
